      "statement": "On the 50-case pack with no embedder, 0.4.0 p50 wall time is about 12.4ms versus about 175.8ms in 0.3.1, roughly 14×; spp is 81.3% versus 83.4%. RAGTruth test quality on 2,675 answers matched 0.3.1. Embedder encoding is extra cost on top of the no-embedder numbers.",
